  def caveats
    <<~EOS
      To give Claude Code the Osyrin Cloud skills (sign in, deploy, people, secrets, domains, backups, logs):
        osy skills install
    EOS
  end

  # `osy --help` exits 0, so the test that expected 1 failed every `brew test` (found 2026-10-19, publishing 0.14.2). The
